sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Service
    participant Kafka as foc.user.status
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant DLQ as foc.badges.dlq

    Note over User: six-month deletion period ends
    User->>Kafka: type UserDeleted, data.userId
    Kafka->>Badges: UserDeleted
    alt another type, e.g. UserVerified
        Badges-->>Kafka: ignored
    else not JSON or fails the schema
        Badges->>DLQ: dead letter, reason invalid
    else UserDeleted
        Note over Badges,DB: one transaction
        Badges->>DB: insert deleted_user, conflict does nothing
        Badges->>DB: delete the user's user_badge, counted_order and user_metrics rows
        Note over Badges,DB: disputed_order keeps the id, only to mark them as a party
    end
